{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_95_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_95","textTraditional":"一、三十有二年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_95_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_95","textTraditional":"二、夏，四月，己丑，鄭伯捷卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_95_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_95","textTraditional":"三、衞人侵狄。秋，衞人及狄盟。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_95_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_95","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月，己卯，晉侯重耳卒。","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}